    schema:description "I built landing pages, maintained SaaS products, and worked with modern web technologies like HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, React, Next.js, Vite, Astro, Twig, Node, SASS, GSAP, and CMS solutions like Typo3. I also built 3D experiences with Three.js and Babylon.js, shipped pixel-perfect UIs with TailwindCSS/SCSS/PostCSS, and used Docker, DDEV, and NGINX for DevOps.";
